          "field": "core_idea",
          "verdict": "issue",
          "quote": "**-ing** makes the form of a verb that shows an action in progress, and the nouns and adjectives that come from that form.",
          "severity": "blocking",
          "family": "definition-meaning",
          "reason": "Not all -ing verb forms show an action in progress; gerunds and participles have broader uses, and many -ing adjectives and nouns are not straightforwardly derived from that verb form."
        },
