          "quote": "added to a verb to make its present participle, used in continuous tenses and to describe an action in progress",
          "severity": "blocking",
          "family": "definition-meaning",
          "reason": "A present participle is also used in non-continuous constructions, such as reduced relative clauses and supplementive clauses; it does not necessarily describe an action in progress."
